+Two repository-wide `swift test` attempts exited 1. All 450 tests ran; the expected 25 ReluxNIOSSH-unavailable known issues were present. Attempt 1 had one unrelated failure in `HEVUDPDatagramAdapterTests.nonterminalRelayErrorsPreserveAssociation`; it immediately passed alone (exit 0). Attempt 2 failed a different HEV UDP timing/lifecycle test with four assertions. Logs: `.temp/TASK-260715-1ue4oy/swift-test-full-01.log`, `swift-test-full-02.log`, and `unrelated-hev-rerun-02.log`. The task-specific suites, relay protocol suite, both Apple product graphs, and generated provider build/resource checks are green; no out-of-scope HEV production/test code was changed.
